  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAO Trainfish/CoC - Fiskeriverket Uppf&#xf6;ljning</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FAO Trainfish/CoC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d genom FAO for tr&#xe4;ning, utbildning, information o  medvetandeg&#xf6;rande f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkt genomf&#xf6;rande av uppf&#xf6;randekoden f&#xf6;r ansvarsfullt fiske. Inkl bla st&#xf6;d till illegalt, orapporterat o oreglerat fiske bla i ofrm av riktlinjer f&#xf6;r port state measures, milj&#xf6;m&#xe4;rkning, status o trender i fisket mm.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support through FAO for traing. education, information and awareness raising for improved implementation of the Code of Conduct for Responsible Fisheries, ia. support to illeagal, unreported and unregulated fishery eg. by gyuideliines for port state measures, status and trends in fishery etc</narrative>
  </description>
